## 2. Pace — are we on track *for the period*?

Time-aware. Plots actual vs. where you "should" be by now given how far through
the period you are, then projects the finish. Turns a static number into
**ahead / on track / behind**.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  New deals this quarter            ▲ AHEAD     │
│                                                │
│  actual    ████████████████████░░░░░  47       │
│  expected  ██████████████░░░░░░░░░░░  33  ▏now  │
│                                                │
│  proj. 63 by Jun 30   ·   goal 55              │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

- **Adds:** `period` (week/month/quarter) + a date field to count "now" against;
  `expected = target · elapsed%`, `projection = value / elapsed%`.
- **Status chip:** ▲ AHEAD (success) · ● ON TRACK (success) · ▼ BEHIND (warning/destructive).
- **Best for:** any goal with a deadline — the single most-requested upgrade to a
  flat progress bar.

